[
  {
    "title": "Efficiency, Limits & Chapter Project",
    "tag": "LESSON 22",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "AAP-4 · Efficiency and limits",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Efficiency, Limits<br>&amp; Chapter Project</h1><p class=\"zh\">效率 · 计算限制 · 学习记录分析器</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Judge an algorithm, then build a useful one.</p>",
    "note": "本章收束，先认识增长、启发式和不可判定，再保留35分钟真实项目。项目整合列表、遍历、过程参数、返回值、选择和输出。课堂项目不是正式Create任务，不引用其评分作保证。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve lists, loops and procedures",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "2–5 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-3.A/B",
    "html": "<ol><li>What does FOR EACH minutes IN sessions assign to minutes?</li><li>Why does a procedure use a parameter such as goal?</li><li>What is returned by RETURN(hits)?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Each list element in order; to let callers provide different thresholds; the current value of hits, with control returning to the caller.</div></details>",
    "note": "这些前置能力直接关系后半节项目。FOR EACH遍历值而不是索引，goal参数避免把阈值30硬写死，RETURN不会自动显示给用户。若错误集中，项目时用流程图支架而不是跳过整合练习。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "5–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-4 · Efficiency and limits",
    "html": "<ol><li>Compare how operation counts grow with input size.</li><li>Distinguish heuristics, slow algorithms and undecidable problems.</li><li>Build a list-processing procedure with a return value.</li><li>Test a Study Session Analyzer and explain its abstractions.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Project time: 45–80 minutes — 35 minutes of building and testing.</p>",
    "note": "把35分钟投向实际动手，前面概念控制在45分钟内。效率不要求形式Big-O推导或证明不可判定；采用表格与定义辨析。项目验收既看运行，也看学生能解释列表和过程的作用。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A problem is broader than one input",
    "tag": "PROBLEM & INSTANCE",
    "time": "8–11 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.1–2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General problem: does a value occur? → One instance: find30 in [20,30,45] → Decision output: yes or no\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">General problem</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">does a value occur?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">One instance</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">find30 in [20,30,45]</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Decision output</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">yes or no</text></svg></figure><p>A decision problem asks yes/no. An optimization problem asks for the best solution under a stated criterion.</p><p class=\"small\">“Does a path exist?” and “What is the shortest path?” impose different requirements.</p>",
    "note": "问题是一般任务，实例是带具体输入的一次任务。严格区分“是否存在路径”的decision与“找最短路径”的optimization，不把所有有输出的问题都叫decision。图的成员关系例子衔接L20。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Estimate work by counting execution",
    "tag": "GROWTH",
    "time": "11–14 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.3/5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"One pass: n operations; all ordered pairs: n² operations; n = 10: 10 or 100 steps, n = 20: 20 or 400 steps\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">One pass: n operations; all ordered pairs: n² operations</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">n = 10</text><text x=\"317.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">10 or 100 steps</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"535.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">n = 20</text><text x=\"867.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">20 or 400 steps</text></svg></figure><p>When input doubles, one pass doubles its work; the pair-count example multiplies its work by four.</p><p class=\"small\">Count operations, not typed lines of code.</p>",
    "note": "例子明确有序对包含自身配对，共n×n，避免学生认为组合数n(n−1)/2。这里只比较规定的核心操作次数，不将两行程序都视为恒定成本，也不要求形式符号证明。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Small inputs can hide rapid growth",
    "tag": "WORKED GROWTH TABLE",
    "time": "14–17 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.5/7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Operation counts for n4:4,16,16,24; n8:8,64,256,40320; n12:12,144,4096,479001600 for n,n squared,2 to n,n factorial.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 272\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Illustrative operation counts · these are formulas, not AP code</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Input n</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">n</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">n²</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">2ⁿ</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"79\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">n!</text><path d=\"M30 101H1180\" stroke=\"#225a83\" opacity=\".3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">16</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">16</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">24</text><path d=\"M30 159H1180\" stroke=\"#225a83\" opacity=\".3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">64</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">256</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">40,320</text><path d=\"M30 217H1180\" stroke=\"#225a83\" opacity=\".3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"570\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">144</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">4096</text><text x=\"1050\" y=\"248\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#28766f\">479,001,600</text></svg></figure><p class=\"small\">At n = 4, n² and 2ⁿ are both 16. Their growth separates as n increases.</p>",
    "note": "n!解释为1到n的连乘，4!=24、8!=40320、12!=479001600；2的n次方是指数，不是2n。数字由程序核验，表只展示illustrativeoperationcounts，不代表某真实应用的秒数或内存消耗。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Reasonable and unreasonable time",
    "tag": "AP CLASSIFICATION",
    "time": "17–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Polynomial or slower: constant, n, n², n³ → Exponential: 2ⁿ → Factorial: n!\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Polynomial or slower</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">constant, n, n², n³</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Exponential</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2ⁿ</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Factorial</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">n!</text></svg></figure><p>AP classifies polynomial growth or slower as reasonable time; exponential and factorial growth as unreasonable time.</p><p class=\"small\">These are growth categories, not a promise about seconds on one device.</p>",
    "note": "按CED原定义表达分类，不混同多项式全都快到用户满意。2ⁿ与n²容易误读，建议学生英文说“two to the n”及“n squared”。本课不用Big-O、不证明定理。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Reasonable does not mean instant",
    "tag": "INTERPRETATION",
    "time": "20–23 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.3/7",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Input size: may be very large → Constant costs: may also matter → Measured example: cannot prove all cases\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Input size</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">may be very large</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Constant costs</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">may also matter</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Measured example</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">cannot prove all cases</text></svg></figure><p>A polynomial-time algorithm can still take substantial time for a particular large input.</p><p class=\"small\">Compare the growth pattern while also considering the practical context.</p>",
    "note": "避免定义标签变成绝对现实承诺。一台更快的机器可以改善某次运行，但不会把指数增长模式变为多项式。单个样例快不证明对所有规模都合理，必须有输入增长背景。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A heuristic trades a guarantee for practicality",
    "tag": "HEURISTIC 启发式",
    "time": "23–26 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.8–9",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Need: a useful result soon → Approach: seek a good candidate → Limit: best is not guaranteed\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Need</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">a useful result soon</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Approach</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">seek a good candidate</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Limit</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">best is not guaranteed</text></svg></figure><p>A heuristic can be appropriate when a guaranteed optimal solution is impractical within the available time.</p><p class=\"small\">It does not prove that the chosen result is optimal.</p>",
    "note": "举需要尽快找到可用路线而不是耗尽所有路线求最短作为背景，不教授具体启发式方案。启发式不是任意胡猜，也不是保证最佳；必须仍评价结果是否满足实用需求。CED排除具体heuristic技术细节。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Time limits and decidability are different",
    "tag": "TWO QUESTIONS",
    "time": "26–29 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.B.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Question 1: does an algorithm exist? → Question 2: how does its work grow? → Keep separate: existence and efficiency\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Question 1</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">does an algorithm exist?</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Question 2</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">how does its work grow?</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Keep separate</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">existence and efficiency</text></svg></figure><p>A slow algorithm can still decide every valid input correctly.</p><p class=\"callout\">Undecidability is not caused merely by insufficient speed.</p>",
    "note": "定义的量词最关键：可判定有能对所有输入正确终止回答的算法；效率讨论该算法用多少资源。慢问题可能可判定，不能把很难算、没学过算法、电脑崩了都叫undecidable。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Undecidable means no universal decider",
    "tag": "UNDECIDABLE 不可判定",
    "time": "29–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.B.2–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Some instances: may be solvable → Every input: requires a universal rule → Undecidable: no always-correct decider\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Some instances</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">may be solvable</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Every input</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">requires a universal rule</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Undecidable</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">no always-correct decider</text></svg></figure><p>No algorithm can always terminate with the correct yes/no answer for every input instance of an undecidable problem.</p><p class=\"small\">Solving some instances does not supply such an algorithm.</p>",
    "note": "不把“部分实例可解”解释为存在可解所有实例的统一过程。课堂只理解存在性与定义，不要求学生判定一个陌生问题是不是不可判定或证明停机问题。明确always包括每个合法输入且完成回答。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check the claims, not the buzzwords",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "32–35 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A/B",
    "html": "<ol><li>A. A heuristic always returns an optimal result.</li><li>B. An exponential-time algorithm must be undecidable.</li><li>C. Some instances of an undecidable problem may be solved.</li><li>D. A polynomial-growth algorithm is classified as reasonable time in AP CSP.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>C and D are true.</strong> A removes the heuristic’s limitation; B confuses high cost with lack of a universal decision algorithm.</div></details>",
    "note": "本页为概念练习，避免虚构某具体开放问题的复杂度分类。学生解释B时可说指数算法既然对所有输入终止给出正确回答就仍可判定，而不是只说“不同”。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: Study Session Analyzer",
    "tag": "PROJECT PURPOSE",
    "time": "35–39 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D · AAP-3.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Input data: list of session minutes → Analysis: count values meeting goal → Output: count + meaningful feedback\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Input data</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">list of session minutes</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Analysis</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count values meeting goal</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Output</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count + meaningful feedback</text></svg></figure><p>Help a learner see how many study sessions met a chosen minute goal.</p><p class=\"small\">Use a list and a reusable procedure instead of separate code for every session.</p>",
    "note": "项目用途是给学习者一个基于数据的反馈，不做真实学习成效诊断。sessions列表存每次分钟，goal由调用者提供。使用相同count逻辑处理不同长度列表，体现数据抽象和过程抽象的具体价值。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A parameterized procedure manages the work",
    "tag": "PROJECT DESIGN",
    "time": "39–42 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-3.B/C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Call: countGoals(sessions, goal) → Inside: traverse + test + count → Return: number of qualifying sessions\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Call</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">countGoals(sessions, goal)</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Inside</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">traverse + test + count</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Return</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">number of qualifying sessions</text></svg></figure><p>Initialize local hits to 0 on each call. Return it after the full traversal.</p><p class=\"callout\">Calling again with a new goal starts a fresh count.</p>",
    "note": "重置位置是过程开头、遍历之前。把hits放在每轮内部会只保留最后一次；不重置则第二次调用可能累计旧结果。RETURN必须在遍历后，放在第一轮就提前返回，漏后续列表元素。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Define the app’s requirements",
    "tag": "PROJECT CONTRACT",
    "time": "42–45 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · CRD-2.B",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Worked data: sessions [20,30,45,10], goal 30; 20: below goal, 30: at goal, 45: above goal, 10: below goal\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Worked data: sessions [20,30,45,10], goal 30</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">20</text><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">below goal</text><rect x=\"325.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">30</text><text x=\"455.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">at goal</text><rect x=\"600.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">45</text><text x=\"730.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">above goal</text><rect x=\"875.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"260.0\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">10</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">below goal</text></svg></figure><p>Valid inputs: a nonempty list of whole-number minutes 0–180 and a whole-number goal 0–180.</p><p class=\"small\">Count minutes ≥ goal. Display count, then “On track” for count ≥ 2; otherwise “Try again”.</p>",
    "note": "这是固定简化反馈标准，看达到目标的session数量，不按总session比例，也不是两天或两小时。空列表是可选拓展，必做先保证非空输入。边界含等号，所以30达到goal30；题目保证有效输入。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: plan and predict",
    "tag": "BUILD · 45–50",
    "time": "45–50 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J · AAP-3.A",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_4_Algorithms_Lab.html#project\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the project starter ↗</a></p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"List: [20,30,45,10] → Goal: 30, then 50 → Predict: count + feedback\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">List</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">[20,30,45,10]</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Goal</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">30, then 50</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Predict</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">count + feedback</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Goal 30: count <strong>2</strong>, “On track”. Goal 50: count <strong>0</strong>, “Try again”.</div></details>",
    "note": "先在项目TODO模板中辨认参数、遍历位置和返回位置，纸面写两次调用预期。不要先把完整教师模型复制给学生。每个调用都独立使用输入列表和goal，错误案例有助检查过程复用是否真实。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: complete the counting procedure",
    "tag": "BUILD · 50–58",
    "time": "50–58 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.a · AAP-3.C",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Before traversal: hits ← 0 → For each minutes: if minutes &gt;= goal: add1 → After traversal: RETURN(hits)\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Before traversal</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">hits ← 0</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">For each minutes</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">if minutes &gt;= goal: add1</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">After traversal</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">RETURN(hits)</text></svg></figure><p>Replace the starter’s TODOs. Keep the test and increment inside the traversal.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Use FOR EACH minutes IN sessions. Inside it, IF(minutes >= goal) increases hits by 1. Place RETURN(hits) after the loop.</div></details>",
    "note": "八分钟学生实际写procedure，图给结构不整段答案。检查goal是否被硬编码30、是否误把分钟累加代替计数、RETURN是否过早。每条语句与大括号单独行，缩进表达块归属；教师指南含完整模型用于核验。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: connect return value to feedback",
    "tag": "BUILD · 58–66",
    "time": "58–66 min",
    "code": "AAP-3.A · AAP-2.H",
    "html": "<div class=\"visual-row\"><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:27px;line-height:1.25;padding:16px;margin:12px 0\">count ← countGoals(sessions, 30)\nDISPLAY(count)</pre><p>Use IF / ELSE after the call.</p><p>Display “On track” for count ≥ 2; otherwise “Try again”.</p></div><p class=\"small\">The procedure returns a number; the application decides what to tell the user.</p>",
    "note": "八分钟整合调用、赋值和输出。RETURN(hits)不会自动显示，调用外count接收结果再决定反馈。分离分析与界面输出让同一过程适用于goal30和50，也便于单独测试返回数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: run boundary and zero-hit tests",
    "tag": "BUILD · 66–74",
    "time": "66–74 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Record expected count, actual count and feedback; [29,30,31]: goal 30, [0,0]: goal 30, [20,30,45,10]: goal 50\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Record expected count, actual count and feedback</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">[29,30,31]</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">goal 30</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">[0,0]</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">goal 30</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">[20,30,45,10]</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">goal 50</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Counts: <strong>2, 0, 0</strong>. Feedback: “On track”, “Try again”, “Try again”. Optional [] returns 0 with this procedure.</div></details>",
    "note": "八分钟测试必须覆盖29/30/31阈值边界、无命中、重复调用改变goal。空列表仅拓展，FOR EACH执行0次，hits保持0返回；程序没有除法，所以不需要额外零长度平均处理。不可用一个正常样例证明普遍正确。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Project: explain and submit the evidence",
    "tag": "BUILD · 74–80",
    "time": "74–80 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D · AAP-3.C · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Submit: program + tests → Explain list: one collection, any length → Explain procedure: same logic, new arguments\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Submit</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">program + tests</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain list</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">one collection, any length</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Explain procedure</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">same logic, new arguments</text></svg></figure><p>Include one corrected mistake and how your test exposed it.</p><p class=\"small\">The final app must show both a numeric count and feedback derived from that count.</p>",
    "note": "最后六分钟核验运行、测试表、抽象解释各一项。学生能指出列表免去逐个独立变量与重复语句；过程参数让同样算法用不同阈值和数据。项目35分钟完成完整开发闭环，不冒充Create正式提交材料。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Which two claims are correct?",
    "tag": "AP-STYLE · SELECT TWO",
    "time": "80–83 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O · AAP-3.C · AAP-4.A",
    "html": "<ol><li>A. Checking every session once is a linear traversal.</li><li>B. A heuristic is guaranteed to find the best result.</li><li>C. Returning inside the first iteration counts every session.</li><li>D. A reusable procedure can process different arguments with the same defined steps.</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>A and D.</strong> Heuristics lack an optimality guarantee; an early RETURN ends the call before remaining elements are processed.</div></details>",
    "note": "综合本章遍历、效率、启发式和过程。A的输入规模指session数，检查每个元素一次为线性核心操作；不要用代码多层IF就判成平方增长。D要有调用者传参实例支撑。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Mixed chapter homework",
    "tag": "CONSOLIDATE",
    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "AAP-4 · Efficiency and limits",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes.</p><ol><li>Review list indexing, traversal and return values.</li><li>Compare searching and robot algorithms.</li><li>Explain efficiency and computational limits accurately.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Keep your finished analyzer and test evidence for later review.</p>",
    "note": "作业是章节混合检测而不只复述本课定义。每题四个独立书面得分点，能定位学生薄弱环节。课堂代码与文档只用于教学练习，日后正式Create须遵守当年官方要求。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Exit ticket: explain one abstraction and one limit",
    "tag": "EXIT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "AAP-4 · Efficiency and limits",
    "html": "<ol><li>What category includes n² growth in AP CSP?</li><li>What guarantee can a heuristic lack?</li><li>Why is undecidable not the same as slow?</li><li>How does countGoals reuse one algorithm?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Reasonable/polynomial; optimality; no algorithm decides every input correctly, rather than merely taking long; parameters let the same steps analyze different lists and goals.</div></details>",
    "note": "收集概念与项目解释四项，至少三项正确且不可判定定义应含所有输入与无统一正确算法。项目另看实际程序，不把能背定义等同能写代码。后续巩固可换列表和goal再调用，不需重复扩展新功能。"
  }
]
